---
// UrgencySection.astro - Clean Layout (No subtitle borders/backgrounds)
---

<section class="urgency-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="urgency-grid">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Realistic Image -->
      <div class="urgency-img-col">
        <div class="img-frame">
          <img 
            src="/assets/images/photos/er-drywall-damage-inspection.webp" 
            alt="Water Damage Moves Fast - ER Emergency Response" 
            class="feature-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Clean Content -->
      <div class="urgency-copy-col">
        
        <!-- H2 Title (Exact copy) -->
        <h2 class="section-title">
          Water Damage Moves Fast. So Should Your Response.
        </h2>

        <!-- Text Paragraphs (Exact copy) -->
        <p class="section-desc" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          Water can travel quickly through carpet, flooring, drywall, and walls. The longer moisture remains, the greater the chance of additional property damage and mold-related issues.
        </p>

        <p class="section-desc" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          ER Emergency Restoration responds with the equipment and experience needed to extract water, dry affected areas, identify hidden moisture, and begin restoring your property.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Points (Exact copy) -->
        <div class="points-wrapper">
          <h4 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: #0C2340; margin: 0 0 14px;">Key Points</h4>
          <ul class="points-list">
            <li>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
              <span>Remove standing water as quickly as possible</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
              <span>Dry affected floors, walls, carpet, and structural materials</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
              <span>Identify moisture that may not be visible at first glance</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-red"></i>
              <span>Document damage and restoration work for your records</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Button (Exact copy) -->
        <div style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a href="#heroLeadFormCard" class="btn-red">
            <span>Get My Emergency Assessment</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .urgency-section {
    padding: 70px 0;
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94) 0%, rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.96) 100%),
                url('/assets/images/photos/er-structural-drying-dehumidifiers.webp') center center / cover no-repeat;
  }
  .urgency-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .img-frame {
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  }
  .feature-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .points-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .points-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1E293B;
  }
  .points-list li i {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .urgency-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .feature-img {
      height: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
